==English==
===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈhoʊ̯m.sɪk/}}

===Etymology===
{{back-formation|en|homesickness}}, equivalent to {{af|en|home|sick}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# (often with ''for'') [[miss#Verb|Missing]] one's [[home]] and [[family]] very much when away; [[nostalgic]].

